UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Dover, New Hampshire, Boulder Technologies, LLC operates as an independent distributor of board-level electronic components. The company was founded with over 25 years of combined industry experience among its team, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed.

The firm provides flexible, value-added distribution services tailored to dynamic market conditions. Its offerings include excess inventory management, outright purchase programs for idle stock, and aggressive sourcing of integrated circuits and passive components. Boulder Technologies maintains a stock of RoHS-compliant parts and emphasizes counterfeit mitigation across its supply chain.

Customers span electronic manufacturers, contract manufacturers, original equipment manufacturers (OEMs), and telecommunication equipment producers. The company positions itself as a strategic partner for these sectors, leveraging its market knowledge and facilities to meet individual customer needs.

Boulder Technologies differentiates itself through its independent status, combined decades of buying and selling expertise, and a commitment to standing behind every component sold. The company was established to serve as a reliable, single-source partner capable of navigating complex component markets while guarding against fraud and unscrupulous practices.', certifications=ARRAY['RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Excess inventory management", "Outright purchase of idle inventory", "Value-added distribution services", "RoHS-compliant component sourcing", "Counterfeit mitigation", "Integrated circuit and passive component distribution"], "industries": ["Electronic manufacturers", "Contract manufacturers", "OEMs", "Telecommunication equipment manufacturers"], "materials": ["Integrated circuits", "Passive electronic components"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 25 years of combined industry experience", "Independent strategic partner for component sourcing", "Flexible services adapted to dynamic markets", "Excess inventory management and outright buy programs", "Counterfeit mitigation and component authenticity guarantee"], "facts_used": ["Location: Dover, NH -> /", "Business type: independent board level electronic components distributor -> /", "Over 25 years combined experience -> /", "Services: flexible, value-added services to electronic manufacturers, contract manufacturers, OEMs, telecom equipment manufacturers -> /", "Excess Management Service -> /", "Outright buys for idle inventory -> /", "Aggressive buyers of IC/Passive components -> /", "Anti-counterfeit commitment -> /", "RoHS compliant parts stocked -> /", "Certification: RoHS -> db", "Headquarters address: 6 Faraday Drive, Dover, NH 03820 -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Boulder Technologies, LLC is an independent board level electronic components distributor located in Dover, NH.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='boulder-technologies' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Boutwell Steel Company operates from Dripping Springs, Texas, serving the surrounding Hill Country region. The company supplies pipe, steel, and metal materials while also building custom steel driveway gates and providing in-house welding and fabrication services. No founding year or ownership structure is disclosed in public materials.

The business runs a full-service welding and fabrication facility that handles projects ranging from heavy equipment repair to structural steel work. Its sales center stocks structural pipe in sizes such as 2-3/8, 2-7/8, and 4-1/2 inches, along with bollards, base plates, square and rectangular tubing, flat bar, angle iron, round bar, C-channel, landscape steel, Corten steel, expanded metal, and steel plate in thicknesses from 14 gauge to one inch. Additional inventory includes hinges, post caps, edging, and stainless steel. The company also offers delivery, cutting, and fabrication on purchased materials.

Customers include ranches, contractors, fabricators, and property owners throughout the Hill Country. Concrete examples of work include custom driveway gates marketed as Texas Edition Gates, heavy equipment welding, and structural steel fabrication for local projects.

