UPDATE companies SET description='Branded Screen Printing & Embroidery was founded in 2009 in Reno, Nevada, as a locally owned and operated shop focused on simplifying custom apparel for area businesses, schools, teams, and events. The company began on Moana Lane with the goal of keeping production in-house to maintain quality and speed, a model it still follows today.

