UPDATE companies SET description='Bright Eye Solar is a locally owned solar installation company based in Lancaster, Pennsylvania. Founded in 2010 by Jim Noden, who serves as owner and CEO, the firm began as a full-service installer handling energy audits, system design, permitting, and installation for residential and commercial customers.

