UPDATE companies SET description='Brooks Molds is based in Elmore, Alabama. Founded in 1999 as a family-owned and operated business by Bobby Brooks, who began his career in the composites industry in 1984 at Mortar Creek Plastics in Elmore, rising to shop supervisor and master pattern maker before launching his own company. His son Timothy now works alongside him.

The company specializes in the tooling and manufacturing of molds for the cast polymer industry, including cultured marble, Tyvarian, and solid surface applications. Using hand layup techniques, they produce both standard and custom molds—bowls, wall panels, vanity tops, shower pans, shower niches, trim molds, and other custom designs. Each mold is built with fiberglass and heavy-duty bracing systems, and every step is monitored by the owners to ensure durability.

Brooks Molds serves cast polymer manufacturers across the United States. Customers include Majestic Kitchen & Bath, Micalline LLC, Amarillo Marble, Elite Marble, The Bath Collection, Carstin Brands, Easton Industries, Custom Bath Products, St. Louis Marble Company, Custom Designer Surface, Hall Marble, and BSWB Inc. These clients rely on the molds for daily production of cultured marble and solid surface products.

The company emphasizes skill and durability as differentiators, citing over 20 years in the cast polymer mold business, immaculate care of permanent master patterns, and the ability to handle both standard and custom design challenges. Their heavy-duty bracing systems are designed to reduce downtime from mold repairs, and they claim their molds last for years under heavy use.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Hand layup mold making", "Custom mold design and engineering", "Standard mold production", "Master pattern making", "Fiberglass mold construction", "Bracing system fabrication", "Tooling for cast polymer industry"], "industries": ["Cast polymer", "Cultured marble", "Solid surface", "Tyvarian"], "materials": ["Fiberglass", "Composite materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["20+ years in the cast polymer mold business", "Permanent master patterns maintained with immaculate care", "Heavy-duty bracing systems designed to withstand heavy use and reduce downtime", "Hand layup construction monitored by owners at every step", "Capability to handle both standard and custom design and build challenges"], "facts_used": ["Location: Elmore, Alabama -> db", "Founded: 1999 -> /about", "Ownership: Family-owned -> /about", "Founder: Bobby Brooks, started composites 1984, launched Brooks Molds 1999 -> /about", "Son Timothy involved -> /about", "Specializes in tooling and manufacturing molds for cast polymer industry -> /", "Process: hand layup -> /", "Products: bowls, wall panels, vanity tops, shower pans, shower niches, trim molds, custom molds -> /", "Materials: fiberglass, durable bracing systems -> /", "Customers: Majestic Kitchen & Bath, Micalline LLC, Amarillo Marble, Elite Marble, The Bath Collection, Carstin Brands, Easton Industries, Custom Bath Products, St. Louis Marble Company, Custom Designer Surface, Hall Marble, BSWB Inc. -> /", "Experience: 20+ years -> /", "Differentiators: master pa