UPDATE companies SET description='BudCo Electric operates from Colorado Springs, Colorado, serving residential and commercial customers across El Paso County. The locally owned electrical contracting company has been active in the community for years, though a specific founding year is not publicly stated. Its team of licensed electricians lives and works in the same neighborhoods they serve, from older downtown districts with aging wiring to newer subdivisions in Briargate and Stetson Hills and rural properties in Black Forest and Peyton.

The company provides a full scope of electrical contracting services. Core offerings include electrical panel replacements and upgrades, subpanel installations, EV charger installation with dedicated circuits, residential wiring and rewiring for remodels and older homes, indoor lighting and ceiling fan installation, whole-home surge protection at the main panel, standby generator installation, and 24-hour emergency response for both residential and commercial clients. Commercial work covers tenant improvements, office build-outs, exterior lighting, and three-phase power upgrades. Most panel replacements are completed in a single day.

BudCo Electric serves homeowners, landlords, builders, business owners, property managers, and general contractors throughout Colorado Springs and the greater El Paso County area. The company regularly works in zip codes spanning central, east, north, and northeast Colorado Springs, as well as Black Forest, Monument, Security-Widefield, Fort Carson, Fountain, Cimarron Hills, Gleneagle, and Peyton. Military families and civilians in the Fort Carson area are noted among its clientele.

The company emphasizes doing work right the first time with no shortcuts, providing straight answers and transparent pricing before work begins, and respecting customers'' homes by showing up on time, using boot covers, protecting floors and walls, and leaving job sites cleaner than they were found. It positions itself as a neighbor-first business that keeps money local and supports Colorado tradespeople.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical panel replacement and upgrades", "Subpanel installation", "Service upgrades", "EV charger installation (Level 2)", "Residential wiring and rewiring", "Indoor lighting installation", "Ceiling fan wiring and installation", "24-hour emergency electrical services", "Whole-home surge protection installation", "Circuit breaker repair and replacement", "Attic fan and ventilation electrical installation", "Standby generator installation", "Commercial tenant improvements", "Office build-outs", "Exterior lighting installation", "Three-phase power upgrades", "Hot tub and spa electrical hookup"], "industries": ["Residential construction and remodeling", "Commercial construction", "Property management", "Real estate"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day service available for many requests; panel replacements typically completed in one day; 24-hour emergency response", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Licensed & insured in Colorado", "Same-day and emergency appointments available", "Free estimates with no hidden fees", "Local team that lives and works in the community", "Panel replacements typically completed in one day"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Colorado Springs, CO -> db", "Locally owned electrical contracting company -> /about", "Serves Colorado Springs and El Paso County -> /, /services", "Licensed & insured in Colorado -> /, /services", "Services: panel upgrades, EV charger install, wiring, lighting, emergency, surge protection, generators, commercial -> /, /services", "Customer types: homeowners, landlords, builders, business owners, property managers, general contractors -> /, /services", "Service areas: multiple zip codes in Colorado Springs, Black Forest, Monument, Security-Widefield, Fort Carson, Fountain, Cimarron Hills, Gleneagle, Peyton -> /services", "Same-day appointments, panel replacements in one day -> /, /services", "Free estimates, no hidden fees -> /, /services", "Team lives and works locally -> /about"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We''re a locally owned electrical contracting company that''s been serving Colorado Springs homeowners and businesses for years... From electrical panel replacements and EV charger installations to 24-hour emergency electrical services, whole-home surge protection, generator installations, and commercial build-outs, we handle the full scope of residential and commercial electrical work.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='budco-electric' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Buhler Inc, the U.S. subsidiary of the Bühler Group, is headquartered in Plymouth, Minnesota.

The company designs and builds processing lines for food, feed, and advanced materials. Its portfolio covers grain milling, extrusion, cocoa and chocolate processing, pasta and snack production, as well as vacuum thin‑film coating, die casting, and wet grinding for batteries, semiconductors, and optical components. Buhler also provides lifecycle services including installation, maintenance, process optimization, upgrades, and a 24/7 hotline, supported by application and training centers such as the Milling Academy.

Customers span the food and feed sectors — animal feed, aqua feed, baked goods, dairy, pet food, and confectionery — and advanced‑materials industries such as battery electrode production, semiconductor packaging, automotive glass coating, and precision optics. Automotive OEMs including Volvo and Hyundai have adopted Bühler megacasting and die‑casting systems for vehicle components.

