UPDATE companies SET description='C & G Custom Woodworks operates from Millbrook, Alabama, as a small custom woodworking shop. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed, nor are the names of its founders. The business presents itself as a hands-on operation focused on craftsmanship and personal attention, with weekday hours from 7 a.m. to 5 p.m. for walk-in consultations.

