UPDATE companies SET description='Cablecom, Inc. was incorporated in May 1986 in Wichita, Kansas, where it remains headquartered in the historic Keep Klean building in the North Old Town district. The company is locally owned and operated, beginning as a cabling services provider and expanding over the decades to include a broader range of communications infrastructure.

Its services encompass structured cabling installed to BICSI standards with manufacturer warranties, scalable network video surveillance solutions, audio-visual system design, installation, and rental, and access control systems using badge credentials. The firm operates from a single Wichita facility and employs a team of technicians who receive ongoing training through BICSI membership.

The company serves businesses and organizations that need conference room upgrades, meeting space audio-visual systems, building surveillance, and access control. Typical projects include flat-panel TV installations, video conferencing suites, and networked camera systems.

