UPDATE companies SET description='Calico Design Manufacturing, LLC was founded in 2017 in Los Angeles, California. The studio operates from East Los Angeles, serving the local community and broader client base with themed fabrication and scenic arts.

The company produces themed environments, decorative arts, and specialty millwork — the hero pieces a space is remembered for. Its two core disciplines run under one roof: scenic arts, covering gold leaf and gilded glass, hand-lettered signage and murals, scenic finishes and patinas, plus art direction and graphic design; and specialty fabrication, delivering themed elements, sculptural pieces, and specialty millwork with in-house design and engineering, multi-axis CNC carving, and full finishing. The shop also handles panel-goods processing, CNC routing, solid-wood carving, and solid-wood machining for bespoke, one-of-a-kind commissions.

Calico serves restaurants, hotels, theaters, attractions, studios, and brands across hospitality, retail, and entertainment sectors. Clients include hospitality venues needing both scenic painting and millwork, entertainment studios requiring sculptural pieces, and retail brands seeking custom installations.

The studio differentiates itself by combining scenic artistry and precision fabrication in a single team with one project management process and design sensibility, eliminating the need for clients to coordinate separate vendors. The company emphasizes hand-applied craft traditions from film and television sets applied to permanent installations.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Scenic finishing", "Gilding", "Hand lettering", "Gold leaf application", "Gilded glass", "Hand-lettered signage", "Murals", "Scenic finishes", "Patinas", "Art direction", "Graphic design", "Panel goods processing", "CNC routing", "Multi-axis CNC carving", "Solid-wood carving", "Solid-wood machining", "Specialty millwork", "Themed element fabrication", "Sculptural piece fabrication", "In-house design and engineering", "Full finishing", "Bespoke object fabrication"], "industries": ["Restaurants", "Hotels", "Theaters", "Attractions", "Studios", "Brands", "Hospitality", "Retail", "Entertainment"], "materials": ["Wood", "Panel goods", "Solid wood", "Gold leaf", "Glass"], "equipment": ["Multi-axis CNC", "CNC router"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Two disciplines under one roof: scenic arts and specialty millwork", "Single team, project management, and design sensibility", "In-house design and engineering with multi-axis CNC carving", "Hand-applied craft traditions (gilding, hand lettering, scenic finishes) combined with precision fabrication", "Quote response typically within 48 hours"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2017 -> db", "Headquarters Los Angeles, CA -> page /", "Services: scenic arts, specialty fabrication, bespoke objects -> page /", "Industries served: restaurants, hotels, theaters, attractions, studios, brands, hospitality, retail, entertainment -> page /", "Processes: scenic finishing, gilding, hand lettering, gold leaf, gilded glass, murals, patinas, art direction, graphic design, panel goods processing, CNC routing, multi-axi