UPDATE companies SET description='California Plastix operates from Pomona, California, in the heart of Southern California''s manufacturing corridor. The company was founded on the principle of delivering reliable, American-made packaging with the flexibility to meet any customer''s needs, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed.

All manufacturing occurs in-house across three integrated departments: extrusion, flexographic printing, and converting. Extrusion lines produce film at widths from 5 to 70 inches layflat and gauges from 0.75 to 8 mil, with a typical tolerance of ±5%. Flexographic presses handle up to six colors with a registration tolerance of ±1/32 inch and repeat lengths of 4 to 24 inches. Converting equipment fabricates side-weld, bottom-seal, gusseted, wicketed, zipper, and tape bags in widths of 3 to 60 inches and lengths of 4 to 72 inches, with wicket counts of 250 to 1,000 bags per wicket. The facility also produces tubing, sheeting, centerfold film, and roll stock.

California Plastix serves food and beverage processors, bakeries, produce packers, industrial manufacturers, retail and e-commerce packagers, medical and pharmaceutical suppliers, agricultural and horticultural operations, and commercial wholesale distributors. Its products are used in supply chains for major retailers such as Costco, The Home Depot, Trader Joe''s, Target, and Bloomingdale''s, though the company notes it is not affiliated with or endorsed by those brands.

The company emphasizes its fully integrated Southern California facility as a differentiator, enabling faster turnaround, direct communication with production staff, and consistent quality control. Quotes are typically provided within 24 hours, and the company ships nationwide from Pomona. Its mission centers on dependable, high-quality poly packaging that helps businesses operate efficiently and keep supply chains moving.', certifications=ARRAY['FDA-COMPLIANT']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Extrusion of LDPE, LLDPE, and MDPE film", "Flexographic printing up to 6 colors", "Converting: side-weld, bottom-seal, gusseted, wicketed, zipper, and tape bags", "Custom film blending with additives (slip, anti-block, anti-static, UV)", "Tubing, sheeting, centerfold film, and roll stock production"], "industries": ["Food & beverage", "Industrial manufacturing", "Retail & packaging", "Medical & pharmaceutical", "E-commerce & fulfillment", "Agriculture & horticulture", "Commercial & wholesale distribution", "Bakeries", "Ice & frozen foods", "Medical & cleanroom", "Distribution & logistics"], "materials": ["LDPE", "LLDPE", "MDPE", "FDA-approved resins"], "equipment": ["Extrusion lines", "Flexographic presses (up to 6-color, 4\u201324\" repeat length)", "Converting equipment (side-weld, bottom-seal, gusseted, wicketed, zipper, tape bags)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "\u00b15% gauge tolerance (extrusion); \u00b11/32\" registration tolerance (printing)", "built_on": ["Fully in-house extrusion, printing, and converting under one roof", "Quotes within 24 hours", "Direct communication with production team", "\u00b15% gauge tolerance and \u00b11/32\" print registration tolerance", "Nationwide shipping from Pomona, CA"], "facts_used": ["Location: Pomona, California -> /about, /, /capabilities", "Founding principle: reliable American-made packaging -> /about", "Processes: extrusion, flexographic printing, converting -> /, /about, /capabilities", "Film specs: LDPE/