UPDATE companies SET description='Carolina Products Inc. was established in 1969 in Charlotte, North Carolina.

The company designs and manufactures custom panel solutions, building control and automation systems, standard control panels, electrical control systems, and fuel pump and dispenser control systems. Its core offering integrates unitized switchgear with building controls in a single package, a configuration covered by five U.S. patents.

Carolina Products serves retail chains, convenience and grocery stores, restaurants, commercial facilities, and industrial facilities. A cited reference comes from Robinson Oil Corporation, whose representative noted reduced energy billing after installing a CPI system.

