ice -> /", "Distributor network across nine Southeast states -> /about-us", "Thrift store partnership program -> /", "Management team with over 40 years experience -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Carolina Textiles is a national leader in the manufacturing and distribution of cleaning cloths, towels, disposable wipers, and cleaning rags.", "founded_year": "1920", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='carolina-textiles' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Carolina Wood Designs was established in 2005 by Michael Osucha in Belmont, North Carolina. Osucha, a general contractor by trade, brought nearly 25 years of experience as a woodworker and precision machinist to the venture, which began as an outlet for designing and building houses, furniture, and cabinetry.

The shop produces handcrafted custom wood furniture and cabinetry, with a focus on kitchen cabinets and one-of-a-kind furniture pieces. Work is performed in Belmont using traditional wood joinery techniques and quality finishing processes on lumber sourced from around the world.

