UPDATE companies SET description='Carson Manufacturing operates from Carson City, Nevada, where it was founded in 1986. The family-owned business traces its roots to Eddie Capps, who purchased the company with his wife Barbara; their daughter Delores Stacy now serves as vice president and her son Kenny Penn as sales engineer. In 1996, the three-generation team introduced a breakthrough redesign that replaced the traditional housing with a bearing holder, creating concentric force alignment that became an industry standard.

The company produces planetary gearheads across five product lines—Precision, Eliminator, ''S'', Right Angle, and fully custom units—with over 231 standard models and ratios up to 10,000:1. An internal R&D division develops and strenuously tests every design under varied conditions. Standard gearheads ship within two days; custom designs with set parameters are delivered in a week. All manufacturing is performed in-house in the United States.

Customers span medical device makers using gearheads for cancer detection, paper manufacturers improving production equipment, aerospace programs such as Embry-Riddle Aeronautical University, motion-control specialists like Servo Systems Co., HVAC firms including MAS HVAC, and automation integrators such as In-Position Technologies. The client base ranges from university research labs to industrial OEMs.

Carson Manufacturing was built on the premise that custom gearhead engineering should not carry a design fee. The firm’s differentiators include free custom design, rigorous in-house testing, a commitment to on-time and on-budget delivery, and a 100% U.S.-made product that avoids tariffs and overseas shipping delays.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Planetary gearhead manufacturing", "Custom planetary gearhead design", "Precision machining", "Gear cutting and grinding", "Assembly and testing", "Research and development", "Rapid custom design (within a week)", "Standard gearhead stocking and 2-day shipping", "Free design engineering for custom parts", "Motor mounting adaptation", "High ratio gearheads (up to 10,000:1)", "IP65/IP54 rated enclosures", "Wide temperature range operation (-20\u00b0F to 250\u00b0F)"], "industries": ["Medical devices", "Paper manufacturing", "Aerospace", "Motion control", "HVAC", "Robotics and automation", "Education and research"], "materials": ["Aluminum (hard-anodized)", "Alloy steel", "Stainless steel", "Hardened steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Standard products ship within 2 days; custom designs within a week", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free custom design engineering with no design fee", "Standard gearheads ship within 2 days", "Custom designs completed within a week", "100% USA manufactured, tariff-free", "Internal R&D division with strenuous testing of every design"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1986 -> db", "Headquarters Carson City, Nevada -> db", "Family-owned, three generations (Eddie Capps, Barbara, Delores Stacy, Kenny Penn) -> /about-us", "1996 redesign using bearing holder -> /about-us", "231+ standard gearhead models -> /", "Standard gearheads ship within 2 days -> /", "Custom designs done in a week -> /", "Manufactured 100% in USA -> /", "Free custom design, no design fee -> /about-us", "Internal R&D division, strenuous testing -> /about-us", "Product lines: Precision, Eliminator, S, Right Angle, Custom -> /about-us", "Ratios up to 10,000:1 -> /about-us", "IP65/IP54 enclosure ratings -> /about-us", "Operating temperature -20\u00b0F to 250\u00b0F -> /about-us", "Materials: hard-anodized aluminum, alloy steel, stainless steel, hardened steel -> /about-us", "Industries served: medical (cancer detection), paper manufacturing, aerospace (Embry-Riddle), motion control (Servo Systems Co.), HVAC (MAS HVAC), automation (In-Position Technologies) -> /about-us and /", "Testimonials from specific companies -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "leading manufacturer of planetary gearheads", "founded_year": "1986", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='carson-manufacturing-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
